    {
      "version": 1,
      "id_scheme_version": 1,
      "article_id": "a1_63cc2ac2f724527fa14d46ba",
      "headline": "A Modder’s RTX 4080 Was Enough To Play AAA Games, But Not For Running LLMs, So He Integrated NVIDIA’s Tesla V100 At A Throwaway Price To Run 27B AI Models",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "Running higher-quality AI models means your existing GPU will have to be equipped with a ton of VRAM to make the experience enjoyable.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-07-27T08:03:35.513722+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "f5b80cbf5adfd1edbf52ad1998c486aec434dd09bc1a8b4241db1aa0a43de3a5",
          "excerpt": "Running higher-quality AI models means your existing GPU will have to be equipped with a ton of VRAM to make the experience enjoyable.",
          "sentence_hash": "ec0dcfb6223ab7a7b9b61f7eb4a47d323d22df2254823a172ea8c086e55636d0",
          "anchors": [
            "with"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "For one RTX 4080 owner, playing the most visually taxing and graphically demanding games might be a walk in the park, but for running LLMs, it’s a Herculean task.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-07-27T08:03:35.513766+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "f5b80cbf5adfd1edbf52ad1998c486aec434dd09bc1a8b4241db1aa0a43de3a5",
          "excerpt": "For one RTX 4080 owner, playing the most visually taxing and graphically demanding games might be a walk in the park, but for running LLMs, it’s a Herculean task.",
          "sentence_hash": "b7fb0a15a778e7f51a12beb3c7a69a4587c500032d144e656b405983dbd8a2c4",
          "anchors": [
            "for",
            "running"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "Wanting to accomplish both feats in a single gaming PC, a modder successfully ran NVIDIA’s Tesla V100 in his system, but encountered a few challenges along the way.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-07-27T08:03:35.513802+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "f5b80cbf5adfd1edbf52ad1998c486aec434dd09bc1a8b4241db1aa0a43de3a5",
          "excerpt": "Wanting to accomplish both feats in a single gaming PC, a modder successfully ran NVIDIA’s Tesla V100 in his system, but encountered a few challenges along the way.",
          "sentence_hash": "9e4d67644c43e5ea57e1684ace0d7f55a92cdc2ad7db75a81e8e3a0d31dd9f08",
          "anchors": [
            "successfully"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "Adding the Tesla V100 grants the modder 32GB of usable VRAM, sufficient for running significantly improved AI models like Qwen 3.6 at 32 tokens/second Before you ask, it’s impossible to attach the Tesla V100 to a desktop motherboard like a “plug and play” job, requiring Tymscar t",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-07-27T08:03:35.513851+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "f5b80cbf5adfd1edbf52ad1998c486aec434dd09bc1a8b4241db1aa0a43de3a5",
          "excerpt": "Adding the Tesla V100 grants the modder 32GB of usable VRAM, sufficient for running significantly improved AI models like Qwen 3.6 at 32 tokens/second Before you ask, it’s impossible to attach the Tesla V100 to a desktop motherboard like a “plug and play” job, requiring Tymscar t",
          "sentence_hash": "00dc2f09e431f9849e5cb068c47b2c93c8301b0837cb4dd35e1e502b7cf4892e",
          "anchors": [
            "for",
            "running"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "Sourcing the GPUs with 16GB of HBM2 memory and the accessory cost him £200, which translates into roughly $266.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-07-27T08:03:35.513879+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "f5b80cbf5adfd1edbf52ad1998c486aec434dd09bc1a8b4241db1aa0a43de3a5",
          "excerpt": "Sourcing the GPUs with 16GB of HBM2 memory and the accessory cost him £200, which translates into roughly $266.",
          "sentence_hash": "174cf076850477ecb6cf19bd9318ff36fad6b9036b3a059659c2161977e9d727",
          "anchors": [
            "with",
            "$266"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "On eBay, you can grab these for only $100 apiece.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-07-27T08:03:35.513901+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "f5b80cbf5adfd1edbf52ad1998c486aec434dd09bc1a8b4241db1aa0a43de3a5",
          "excerpt": "On eBay, you can grab these for only $100 apiece.",
          "sentence_hash": "fde5df0f6216e1faab2800de2c0fb771dee5897c3115b62a0e708be029a36ea2",
          "anchors": [
            "for",
            "$100 "
          ]
        }
